Дано machine.json (ProjectContext::ConfigDirectory) has "HideRayTracing": true; editor started after the edit.
Когда state device
Когда run View "View mode: Lit"
Тогда-вид nort_state после 90 кадров: кадр не чёрный (mean > 0), 0 VUID; state device: rt = "hidden", rtModes = ["None"], pathTracing.available = false с reason «the device offers no ray query», pathTracing.active = false, methods.gi / reflections / shadows не HardwareTraced/PathTraced/Stochastic (rows с «(the device offers no ray query)» там, где сцена просила трассировку); editor.log: «[Vulkan] ray tracing hidden by ... (HideRayTracing)», caps-строка acceleration_structure/ray_query/ray_tracing_pipeline=hidden, «[MeshService] no BLAS is built for meshes: ray tracing is hidden by machine.json (HideRayTracing) on this device» один раз, ни одной строки TLAS/BLAS.
